# Python
venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# PyInstaller build output (see README.md "Building a standalone EXE"), plus the portable
# release/ folder assembled from it (EXE + bundled tesseract/models -- see "Portable / USB-stick
# deployment"): both are build artifacts, not source, and release/ in particular is ~1GB.
build/
dist/
release/
*.spec
*.zip

# Runtime-generated data now lives under %LOCALAPPDATA%\Kontroll\, not the project directory
# (see config/app_paths.py) -- these are only ignored defensively in case older code or a stray
# script ever recreates them here.
data/
logs/

# Optional portable copies of Tesseract OCR and the InsightFace model, placed next to main.py (or
# next to Kontroll.exe in a build) for USB-stick/relocatable deployment -- see config/bundled_deps.py
# and README.md "Portable / USB-stick deployment". Large, machine-downloaded binaries, not source.
/tesseract/
/models/

# Editors / OS
.vscode/
.idea/
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store

# Claude Code local session state/config -- .claude/ covers per-project settings, hooks, and
# session state (nothing in here is currently populated, but the whole directory is excluded
# defensively); .mcp.json and CLAUDE.local.md are Claude Code config files that can live at the
# project root instead. CLAUDE.md itself is deliberately NOT excluded -- unlike these, it's
# checked-in project documentation (see the "Add CLAUDE.md" commit), not local tool state.
.claude/
.mcp.json
CLAUDE.local.md

# --- Baseline: macOS, Claude Code and secrets ---
._*
.remember/
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx

# Tooling caches
.ruff_cache/
.pytest_cache/
